# kite-protocol 0.3
T	2026-11-16
A	say Moving checklist ready. Two items are done.
A	topic move Moving Day
A	card k1 checklist move 3x3 Before the truck comes
A	add k1 i1 done | Book the movers
A	add k1 i2 done | Cancel the internet
A	add k1 i3 todo | Pack the kitchen
A	add k1 i4 todo | Return the keys
A	card k2 progress move 3x3 Packing
A	set k2 pct 40
A	set k2 text 2 of 5 rooms boxed
A	add k2 s1 done | Bedroom
A	add k2 s2 done | Study
A	add k2 s3 run | Kitchen
A	add k2 s4 todo | Bathroom
A	add k2 s5 todo | Living room
A	card k3 metric move 2x2 Days left
A	set k3 value 9
A	set k3 unit days
